    "title": "Vacancy for Medical Officer at Bombay Hospital South Asia Partners",
    "description": "Bombay Hospital South Asia Partners, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Medical Officer for our Vijayawada operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout Bombay Hospital South Asia Partners:\nBombay Hospital South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n• Monitor patient progress and adjust treatment plans accordingly\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n• Proficiency in NABH Standards\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in CPT Codes\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in Clinical Research\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Referral bonus program\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Learning & development budget\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Bombay Hospital South Asia Partners!",
